<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Jolt</h1>
<p>Sphere: Electricity Sphere
Spell Tier: 2
Class: Sorcerer (guild level 16)
Mana: 24
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast jolt &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast jolt</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>The caster forks two fingers at the target and utters the word 'Spaerx', 
and a charge of lightning arcs across to strike them. The better your 
magic and your electricity sphere, the harder it strikes. It does best 
against clothes and light leather and much less against chain and plate, 
and a shield is no use against it.
</p><p>Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. It can be cast while fighting, 
and no free hands are needed. It is also found on wands, staffs and 
scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Electrical Shock</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Lightning Bolt</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Electricity Resistance</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Electricity Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>